<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Haitian security forces have retaken the national stadium after two years of gang control and police killed a gang leader while intensifying operations against other sites, with kidnappings rising in Port-au-Prince. Salvadoran troops and missiles have struck a gang hideout, destroying the Mawozo headquarters and killing about 20 gang members. A claim circulated that robots are killing gang members in Haiti. Widow Martine Moise, whose husband was assassinated, has registered to contest the presidential election. The UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQcUp1WjVJNldVU1VsZzFDdHZsVWpjeDZTX3NoQWZJVzBjQWZQSVhfSjF0QXRmMVMyQk43SFRnOG1TRnd0cUJXNWVNZ20zREFEUVo4SThsRTFncUhhZjI0V0oxRWpDSnhxLUNacHBOS3FDU0xsam04ZXNvdmJWSXoxUHE0ZVhDdnBjZG1wVGJrX0FSVkV3SU8yWDlsVEtXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9yamFTb2tCZ1NtbmYtZkprVVpwMWN1dHVsNEJQWW11NWZKRTJJLTd3bUJRbDJCWUFsSzIzWVBfd1VsUlNhbkxHMUFUYkNSckxVVjVzWnUyTEFEdTFJd3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNVkNQTXoxOGh0Nnd1S2NROXpRcENSbk1sdTdwNUFiVmFobnRPbjdCUG1LcFlHYi0tMDlJby1oSC1nWnFMRjlZSGpGVFhJSWVhUVZMVHhndDFJazV4NmZJSnZDc1Q1VDZlNVpQRDdFLXpZM0JEZC1BRFBHTUZLU0ozX25jUWUxQS1EMGIwdVRxbVNpUmwyaUx0QVBaYjNxQzZ1S1RWVGlIWm15a2xteGdXalI2LVM4a1dJam4wRnBUVnVNVDBk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNZ0l4WFEwRDRPOFo2TUcybUQ4NzNlOXJ3TDE1blRsREoyX3k1UGpMMFJGOWRjbEUzZkhVZW1kNlQ5SU1zV0NGRXcxUE5zcUF4RzBVWTZ1WkZLUE5DMmFCazZlMXpJaHpRTkgtMFB0WGRvYWZZ